  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the curve satisfying the differential equation&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math> and passing through the origin is",
